// 三维场景播放器（界面进程）。播放位置在时序进程，机体状态在飞行场景进程，烟尘火焰在环境特效进程，
// 飞控在飞控进程；这里只负责窗口、控件和把输入变成消息。投送时再渲染一份同样的界面到目标桌面。
include "/System/lib/ui.nest";

let ME = null;
let TL = 0, FLIGHT = 0, FX = 0, FC = 0;
let SCENE_PATH = "", PATH_TEXT = "/Demo/helicopter-24.scene";
let SCENE_TEXT = null;
let RECORD = null;      // 打开 .flight 时的记录
let ST = { pos: 0, duration: 15, state: "stopped", rate: 1, loop: false, frame_time: 0, mode: "record", fps: 60, lag: 0, ctl_period: 0, crashed: false, agl: 0, speed: 0 };
let CAM_MODE = "show";
let ORBIT = { yaw: 0.8, pitch: 0.35, dist: 22 };
let SELECT_TEXT = "点击视图中的部件查看名称和损坏状态";
let MSG = "";
let MSG_ERR = false;
let REH_OPEN = false;
let WIND = 0, WIND_DIR = 0, HEADING = "", FAULT = "tail", CTRL_PATH = "/Flight/flightctl.nest";
let PROJ = {};           // 目标路径 -> { id, sid, target }
let POPUP = null;
let DRAG = null;
let FRAME_READY = false;
let SAVE_NAME = "/Documents/排演记录.flight";

const TOP_H = 38, BOT_H = 74;

function set_msg(t, e) { MSG = t; MSG_ERR = e == true; ui_invalidate(); }
function fmt_time(t) {
  let m = floor(t / 60), s = t - m * 60;
  return pad_left(str(m), 2, "0") + ":" + pad_left(fmt(s, 2), 5, "0");
}
function state_cn(s) {
  if (s == "playing") return "播放中";
  if (s == "paused") return "已暂停";
  if (s == "ended") return "已播完";
  if (s == "stopped") return "已停止";
  if (s == "rehearsal") return "排演中";
  return s;
}
function time_text() {
  return fmt_time(ST.frame_time) + " / " + fmt_time(ST.duration) + " · " + str(ST.rate) + "× · " + state_cn(ST.mode == "rehearsal" && ST.state == "playing" ? "rehearsal" : ST.state) + " · " + str(ST.fps) + " 帧/秒";
}

// —— 载入 ——
function open_scene(path) {
  let t = read_file(path);
  if (t == null) { set_msg("打开失败：文件不存在 " + path, true); return false; }
  let text = t;
  let rec = null;
  if (ext_of(path) == "flight") {
    let d = null;
    try { d = json_parse(t); } catch (e) { set_msg("记录文件损坏：" + str(e), true); return false; }
    if (d.format != "nest-flight") { set_msg("不是排演记录文件", true); return false; }
    text = d.scene;
    rec = d.record;
  }
  let vids = keys(VIEWS_UI);
  for (let s of vids) {
    let r = sys("gfx_open", s + "v", text);
    if (is_err(r)) { set_msg("载入失败：" + r.error, true); return false; }
  }
  SCENE_PATH = path;
  PATH_TEXT = path;
  SCENE_TEXT = text;
  RECORD = rec;
  stop_fc();
  // 先通知时序进程，保证它在飞行进程回复“已载入”之前进入载入状态
  send(TL, { type: "load", path: path });
  send(FX, { type: "reset" });
  send(FLIGHT, { type: "load", text: text, record: rec });
  sys("win_set", UI_MAIN.wid, { title: base_of(path) + " — 三维播放器" });
  set_msg("已打开 " + path + "（" + fmt_bytes(len(text)) + "）", false);
  return true;
}
function stop_fc() {
  if (FC != 0) { sys("kill", FC); FC = 0; }
}
function view_list() {
  let out = [];
  let ids = keys(VIEWS_UI);
  for (let s of ids) push(out, s + "v");
  return out;
}
function sync_views() { send(TL, { type: "views", vids: view_list() }); }

// —— 绘制（每个视图一份：源窗口和投送窗口尺寸不同，各自取景）——
function render(v) {
  let W = v.w, H = v.h;
  let out = [];
  let vh = H - TOP_H - BOT_H;
  if (vh < 60) vh = 60;
  // 顶栏
  push(out, B("open", 8, 6, 54, 26, "打开", "open", null, { tid: "player-open", cls: "small" }));
  let bw = W > 620 ? 74 : 54;
  push(out, INPUT("path", 66, 6, W - 66 - bw - 12, 26, PATH_TEXT, { tid: "player-path", label: "场景文件路径", ph: "/Demo/helicopter-24.scene" }));
  if (v.kind == "main") push(out, B("proj", W - bw - 8, 6, bw, 26, W > 620 ? "投送…" : "投送", "project", null, { tid: "window-project", cls: "small", label: "投送到祖先桌面" }));
  else push(out, T("pjlabel", W - bw - 8, 6, bw, 26, "field-label", "投送视图"));
  // 三维视图
  push(out, { k: "v3d", t: "view3d", vid: v.sid + "v", x: 0, y: TOP_H, w: W, h: vh, cls: "view3d", tid: "player-view", label: "三维视图" });
  hit(0, TOP_H, W, vh, "view", null);
  // 视图上的状态
  let badge = state_cn(ST.mode == "rehearsal" && ST.state == "playing" ? "rehearsal" : ST.state);
  if (ST.mode == "rehearsal") {
    badge = badge + " · 控制周期 " + fmt(ST.ctl_period * 1000, 0) + " ms · 离地 " + fmt(ST.agl, 1) + " m · " + fmt(ST.speed, 1) + " m/s";
    if (ST.lag > 0.05) badge = badge + " · 物理落后 " + fmt(ST.lag, 2) + " s";
  }
  if (ST.crashed) badge = "已坠毁 · " + badge;
  push(out, T("badge", 8, TOP_H + 8, min(W - 16, 13 * len(badge) + 18), 22, ST.crashed ? "player-badge warn" : "player-badge", badge));
  // 底部一：传输控制
  let y = TOP_H + vh + 4;
  let x = 8;
  let tb = [["播放", "play", "player-play"], ["暂停", "pause", "player-pause"], ["停止", "stop", "player-stop"], ["重播", "replay", "player-replay"], ["逐帧", "step", "player-step"]];
  let cw = W > 560 ? 44 : 36;
  for (let t of tb) {
    push(out, B("t" + t[1], x, y, cw, 28, t[0], t[1], null, { tid: t[2], cls: "small", on: (t[1] == "play" && ST.state == "playing") || (t[1] == "pause" && ST.state == "paused") }));
    x = x + cw + 2;
  }
  push(out, B("tloop", x, y, cw, 28, "循环", "loop", null, { tid: "player-loop", cls: "small", on: ST.loop }));
  x = x + cw + 6;
  let tw = W > 760 ? 300 : 0;
  push(out, RANGE("seek", x, y + 4, W - x - tw - 12, 20, ST.pos, 0, ST.duration, 0.01, { tid: "player-seek", label: "播放进度" }));
  if (tw > 0) push(out, T("ptime", W - tw - 4, y, tw, 28, "player-time", time_text()));
  // 底部二
  y = y + 32;
  x = 8;
  push(out, SELECT("rate", x, y + 2, 72, 26, str(ST.rate), [["0.25", "0.25×"], ["0.5", "0.5×"], ["1", "1×"], ["2", "2×"], ["4", "4×"]], { tid: "player-rate", label: "播放速率" }));
  x = x + 76;
  push(out, SELECT("cam", x, y + 2, 92, 26, CAM_MODE, [["show", "演出镜头"], ["follow", "跟随镜头"], ["free", "自由环绕"]], { tid: "player-camera", label: "镜头" }));
  x = x + 96;
  push(out, B("reh", x, y + 2, 74, 26, REH_OPEN ? "收起排演" : "飞行排演", "reh_toggle", null, { cls: "small", on: REH_OPEN, tid: "rehearsal-toggle" }));
  x = x + 78;
  if (tw == 0) {
    push(out, T("ptime", x, y + 2, W - x - 8, 26, "player-time", fmt_time(ST.frame_time) + " / " + fmt_time(ST.duration)));
  } else {
    let sel = MSG != "" ? MSG : SELECT_TEXT;
    push(out, { k: "psel", x: x, y: y + 2, w: W - x - 8, h: 24, cls: MSG_ERR ? "player-selection status err" : "player-selection", tid: "player-selection", text: sel });
  }
  if (tw == 0) push(out, { k: "psel", x: 8, y: TOP_H + vh - 26, w: W - 16, h: 22, cls: "player-badge", tid: "player-selection", text: MSG != "" ? MSG : SELECT_TEXT });
  // 排演面板
  if (REH_OPEN) render_rehearsal(v, out, vh);
  if (POPUP != null && POPUP.sid == v.sid) render_popup(v, out);
  return out;
}
function render_rehearsal(v, out, vh) {
  let pw = 248;
  let px = v.w - pw - 8, py = TOP_H + 8;
  let ph = 338;
  if (ph > vh - 16) ph = vh - 16;
  hit(px, py, pw, ph, "noop", null);
  let k = [];
  let y = 8;
  push(k, T("h", 10, y, pw - 20, 22, "panel-title small", "飞行排演"));
  y = y + 26;
  let startLabel = ST.mode == "rehearsal" ? "重新从当前位置排演" : "从当前位置开始排演";
  let abs_x = px;
  k = panel_btn(k, "start", 10, y, pw - 20, startLabel, "reh_start", "rehearsal-start", "primary", abs_x, py);
  y = y + 32;
  push(k, T("wl", 10, y, 60, 26, "field-label left", "风速"));
  push(k, RANGE("wind", 66, y + 3, pw - 110, 20, WIND, 0, 20, 0.5, { tid: "rehearsal-wind", label: "风速 米每秒" }));
  push(k, T("wv", pw - 42, y, 36, 26, "field-label", fmt(WIND, 0)));
  y = y + 28;
  push(k, T("wdl", 10, y, 60, 26, "field-label left", "风向°"));
  push(k, INPUT("winddir", 66, y, pw - 76, 26, str(WIND_DIR), { tid: "rehearsal-wind-dir", label: "风向（度）", type: "number" }));
  y = y + 30;
  push(k, T("hl", 10, y, 60, 26, "field-label left", "航向°"));
  push(k, INPUT("heading", 66, y, pw - 76, 26, HEADING, { tid: "rehearsal-heading", label: "目标航向（度）", ph: "也可点击地面", type: "number" }));
  y = y + 30;
  push(k, T("fl", 10, y, 60, 26, "field-label left", "故障"));
  push(k, SELECT("fault", 66, y, 92, 26, FAULT, [["tail", "尾桨失效"], ["engine", "发动机停车"], ["blade", "桨叶受损"]], { tid: "rehearsal-fault-kind", label: "故障类型" }));
  k = panel_btn(k, "ftrig", 162, y, pw - 172, "触发", "reh_fault", "rehearsal-fault", "small", abs_x, py);
  y = y + 30;
  push(k, T("cl", 10, y, 60, 26, "field-label left", "飞控"));
  push(k, INPUT("ctrl", 66, y, pw - 76, 26, CTRL_PATH, { tid: "rehearsal-controller", label: "飞控程序路径" }));
  y = y + 30;
  k = panel_btn(k, "land", 10, y, floor((pw - 24) / 2), "飞往 2 号坪降落", "reh_land", "rehearsal-land", "small", abs_x, py);
  k = panel_btn(k, "pad1", 14 + floor((pw - 24) / 2), y, floor((pw - 24) / 2), "悬停", "reh_hover", "rehearsal-hover", "small", abs_x, py);
  y = y + 30;
  push(k, INPUT("savename", 10, y, pw - 74, 26, SAVE_NAME, { tid: "rehearsal-save-path", label: "记录保存路径" }));
  k = panel_btn(k, "save", pw - 60, y, 50, "保存", "reh_save", "rehearsal-save", "small", abs_x, py);
  push(out, N("rehp", px, py, pw, ph, "player-panel", k));
}
function panel_btn(k, key, x, y, w, text, act, tid, cls, ox, oy) {
  push(k, { k: key, x: x, y: y, w: w, h: 26, cls: "btn small " + cls, text: text, tid: tid, role: "button", label: text });
  hit(ox + x, oy + y, w, 26, act, null);
  return k;
}
function render_popup(v, out) {
  let list = POPUP.list;
  let pw = 260;
  let ph = 12 + len(list) * 34;
  let px = v.w - pw - 8, py = TOP_H;
  hit(px, py, pw, ph, "noop", null);
  let k = [];
  let y = 6, i = 0;
  for (let a of list) {
    let text = a.id + " · 第 " + str(a.level) + " 层桌面";
    push(k, { k: "t" + str(i), x: 6, y: y, w: pw - 12, h: 32, cls: "popup-item", text: text, tid: "project-target", role: "button", label: "投送到 " + a.id, a: { "data-target-system-id": a.id } });
    hit(px + 6, py + y, pw - 12, 32, "project_to", a.path);
    y = y + 34;
    i = i + 1;
  }
  push(out, N("popup", px, py, pw, ph, "popup-list", k));
}

// —— 输入 ——
function on_act(v, act, data, ev) {
  if (POPUP != null && act != "project" && act != "project_to") { POPUP = null; ui_invalidate(); }
  if (act == "open") { MSG = ""; open_scene(trim(PATH_TEXT)); return; }
  if (act == "play") { send(TL, { type: "play" }); return; }
  if (act == "pause") { send(TL, { type: "pause" }); return; }
  if (act == "stop") { send(TL, { type: "stop" }); return; }
  if (act == "replay") { send(TL, { type: "replay" }); return; }
  if (act == "step") { send(TL, { type: "step" }); return; }
  if (act == "loop") { send(TL, { type: "loop" }); return; }
  if (act == "reh_toggle") { REH_OPEN = !REH_OPEN; ui_invalidate(); return; }
  if (act == "reh_start") { start_rehearsal(); return; }
  if (act == "reh_fault") { send(FLIGHT, { type: "input", kind: "fault", a: FAULT }); set_msg("已触发故障：" + FAULT, false); return; }
  if (act == "reh_land") { send(FLIGHT, { type: "goal_land", index: 1 }); set_msg("目标：飞往 2 号停机坪并降落", false); return; }
  if (act == "reh_hover") { send(FLIGHT, { type: "goal_hover" }); set_msg("目标：原地悬停", false); return; }
  if (act == "reh_save") { send(FLIGHT, { type: "get_record" }); return; }
  if (act == "project") { open_project_popup(v); return; }
  if (act == "project_to") { project_to(data); return; }
}
function open_project_popup(v) {
  let list = sys("ancestors");
  if (len(list) == 0) { set_msg("这个系统没有祖先桌面", true); return; }
  POPUP = { sid: v.sid, list: reverse(list) };
  ui_invalidate();
}
function project_to(target) {
  POPUP = null;
  ui_invalidate();
  // 每个源窗口至多对应一个投送窗口，再次投送聚焦已有窗口
  let keys_p = keys(PROJ);
  if (len(keys_p) > 0) {
    let r = PROJ[keys_p[0]];
    sys("proj_focus", r.id, r.target);
    return;
  }
  let sid = sys("surface_new");
  let w = 860, h = 560;
  let view = view_new(sid, w, h, "proj");
  if (SCENE_TEXT != null) {
    let r = sys("gfx_open", sid + "v", SCENE_TEXT);
    if (is_err(r)) { del(VIEWS_UI, sid); set_msg("投送失败：" + r.error, true); return; }
  }
  sync_views();
  ui_render_view(view);
  let id = sys("proj_open", { target: target, sid: sid, wid: UI_MAIN.wid, app: "player", title: (SCENE_PATH != "" ? base_of(SCENE_PATH) : "三维播放器") + " — 播放器", w: w, h: h });
  PROJ[sid] = { id: id, sid: sid, target: target };
  send(TL, { type: "refresh" });
  set_msg("已投送到 " + target, false);
}
function start_rehearsal() {
  stop_fc();
  let bus = "player" + str(ME.pid);
  let r = spawn(trim(CTRL_PATH), { bus: bus }, { join_group: true, name: "飞控进程", app: "player" });
  if (is_err(r)) { set_msg("飞控启动失败：" + r.error, true); return; }
  FC = r;
  send(FLIGHT, { type: "rehearsal", bus: bus });
  send(TL, { type: "rehearsal" });
  set_msg("排演开始：飞控进程 " + str(FC), false);
}
function on_down(v, r, ev) {
  if (POPUP != null) { if (r == null || (r.act != "noop" && r.act != "project_to" && r.act != "project")) { POPUP = null; ui_invalidate(); } }
  if (r != null && r.act == "view") DRAG = { sid: v.sid, x: ev.x, y: ev.y, moved: false, yaw: ORBIT.yaw, pitch: ORBIT.pitch };
}
function on_move(v, ev) {
  if (DRAG == null || DRAG.sid != v.sid) return;
  let dx = ev.x - DRAG.x, dy = ev.y - DRAG.y;
  if (!DRAG.moved && abs(dx) + abs(dy) < 5) return;
  DRAG.moved = true;
  if (CAM_MODE != "free") { CAM_MODE = "free"; ui_invalidate(); }
  ORBIT.yaw = DRAG.yaw + dx * 0.008;
  ORBIT.pitch = clampf(DRAG.pitch + dy * 0.006, -0.1, 1.45);
  send(TL, { type: "camera", mode: CAM_MODE, orbit: ORBIT });
}
function on_up(v, ev) {
  let d = DRAG;
  DRAG = null;
  if (d == null || d.moved || d.sid != v.sid || ev.cancel) return;
  // 点选：设备按当前提交求交
  let p = sys("gfx_pick", v.sid + "v", ev.x, ev.y - TOP_H);
  if (p == null) { SELECT_TEXT = "没有选中对象"; ui_invalidate(); return; }
  if (p.kind == "ground" && ST.mode == "rehearsal") {
    send(FLIGHT, { type: "ground_click", x: p.point[0], z: p.point[2] });
    SELECT_TEXT = "目标航向已指向地面点 (" + fmt(p.point[0], 0) + ", " + fmt(p.point[2], 0) + ")";
    MSG = "";
    ui_invalidate();
    return;
  }
  if (p.kind == "part") { send(FLIGHT, { type: "part_status", name: p.name }); return; }
  SELECT_TEXT = p.name;
  MSG = "";
  ui_invalidate();
}
function on_wheel(v, r, ev) {
  if (r == null || r.act != "view") return;
  ORBIT.dist = clampf(ORBIT.dist * (ev.dy > 0 ? 1.1 : 0.9), 7, 240);
  if (CAM_MODE != "free") { CAM_MODE = "free"; ui_invalidate(); }
  send(TL, { type: "camera", mode: CAM_MODE, orbit: ORBIT });
}
function on_value(v, key, value) {
  if (key == "path") { PATH_TEXT = value; return; }
  if (key == "seek") { let t = num(value); if (t != null) send(TL, { type: "seek", t: t }); return; }
  if (key == "rate") { let r = num(value); if (r != null) send(TL, { type: "rate", rate: r }); return; }
  if (key == "cam") { CAM_MODE = value; send(TL, { type: "camera", mode: value, orbit: ORBIT }); ui_invalidate(); return; }
  if (key == "wind") { WIND = num(value); apply_wind(); ui_invalidate(); return; }
  if (key == "winddir") { WIND_DIR = num(value); if (WIND_DIR == null) WIND_DIR = 0; apply_wind(); return; }
  if (key == "heading") {
    HEADING = value;
    let d = num(value);
    if (d != null) send(FLIGHT, { type: "goal_heading", heading: d * 3.14159265 / 180 });
    return;
  }
  if (key == "fault") { FAULT = value; return; }
  if (key == "ctrl") { CTRL_PATH = value; return; }
  if (key == "savename") { SAVE_NAME = value; return; }
}
function apply_wind() {
  let a = WIND_DIR * 3.14159265 / 180;
  send(FLIGHT, { type: "input", kind: "wind", a: cos(a) * WIND, b: sin(a) * WIND });
}
function on_key(v, ev) {
  if (ev.k != "keydown") return;
  if (ev.key == "Enter" && ev.native) { open_scene(trim(PATH_TEXT)); return; }
  if (ev.native) return;
  if (ev.key == " ") send(TL, { type: ST.state == "playing" ? "pause" : "play" });
  else if (ev.key == "ArrowRight") send(TL, { type: "step" });
}
function patch_status() {
  let vids = keys(VIEWS_UI);
  let tt = time_text();
  for (let s of vids) {
    let v = VIEWS_UI[s];
    sys("ui_patch", s, "ptime", { text: v.w > 760 ? tt : fmt_time(ST.frame_time) + " / " + fmt_time(ST.duration) });
    sys("ui_patch", s, "seek", { val: ST.pos, max: ST.duration });
  }
}
function on_msg(m) {
  let d = m.data;
  let t = d.type;
  if (t == "status") {
    let structural = d.state != ST.state || d.loop != ST.loop || d.rate != ST.rate || d.mode != ST.mode || d.crashed != ST.crashed;
    let badge_change = d.mode == "rehearsal";
    ST = d;
    if (structural || badge_change) ui_invalidate();
    else if (!UI_DIRTY) patch_status();
    return;
  }
  if (t == "part_info") {
    SELECT_TEXT = "部件：" + d.name + " · 状态：" + d.status;
    MSG = "";
    ui_invalidate();
    return;
  }
  if (t == "note") { set_msg(d.text, d.err); return; }
  if (t == "record") {
    let doc = { format: "nest-flight", version: 1, scene_path: SCENE_PATH, scene: SCENE_TEXT, record: d.rec };
    let r = sys("fs_write", trim(SAVE_NAME), json_str(doc));
    if (is_err(r)) set_msg("保存失败：" + r.error, true);
    else set_msg("排演记录已保存：" + trim(SAVE_NAME), false);
    return;
  }
  if (t == "proj_closed") {
    let v = VIEWS_UI[d.sid];
    if (v != null) {
      sys("gfx_close", d.sid + "v");
      del(VIEWS_UI, d.sid);
      del(PROJ, d.sid);
      sync_views();
      set_msg("投送已取消，播放器继续运行", false);
    }
    return;
  }
  if (t == "sys_restored") { on_restored(d); return; }
  if (t == "scene_done") { FRAME_READY = true; return; }
}
// 快照恢复或分叉后：范围内的投送随快照恢复；范围外的外框按逻辑身份对应
function on_restored(d) {
  let ids = keys(PROJ);
  let scope = d.scope;
  for (let sid of ids) {
    let r = PROJ[sid];
    let inside = r.target == scope || starts_with(r.target, scope + "/");
    if (inside) continue;
    let keep = false;
    if (d.mode != "fork") {
      for (let e of d.ext) if (e.sid == sid) keep = true;
    }
    if (!keep) {
      sys("gfx_close", sid + "v");
      del(VIEWS_UI, sid);
      del(PROJ, sid);
    }
  }
  // 现存的范围外外框如果在快照里还没有对应视图，恢复后接管它
  if (d.mode != "fork" && d.ext != null) {
    for (let e of d.ext) {
      if (e.src_win == UI_MAIN.wid && VIEWS_UI[e.sid] == null) {
        view_new(e.sid, e.w != null ? e.w : 860, e.h != null ? e.h : 560, "proj");
        if (SCENE_TEXT != null) sys("gfx_open", e.sid + "v", SCENE_TEXT);
        PROJ[e.sid] = { id: e.id, sid: e.sid, target: e.target };
      }
    }
  }
  sync_views();
  send(TL, { type: "refresh" });
  ui_invalidate();
}
function on_close() {
  let keys_p = keys(PROJ);
  for (let s of keys_p) sys("proj_close", PROJ[s].id, "源窗口已关闭");
  return true;
}
function resized(v) { send(TL, { type: "refresh" }); }

function main(args) {
  ME = self();
  app_window("三维播放器", "player", 900, 620, "player");
  TL = spawn("/System/apps/player_timeline.nest", { ui: ME.pid, wid: UI_MAIN.wid, system: ME.system }, { join_group: true, name: "时序进程", app: "player" });
  FLIGHT = spawn("/System/apps/player_flight.nest", { timeline: TL }, { join_group: true, name: "飞行场景进程", app: "player" });
  FX = spawn("/System/apps/player_fx.nest", { timeline: TL }, { join_group: true, name: "环境特效进程", app: "player" });
  if (is_err(TL) || is_err(FLIGHT) || is_err(FX)) { sys("notify", "播放器进程启动失败", "error"); return 1; }
  send(TL, { type: "init", flight: FLIGHT, fx: FX });
  send(FLIGHT, { type: "init", fx: FX, ui: ME.pid });
  sync_views();
  if (args != null && args.file != null) open_scene(args.file);
  app_run({ render: render, act: on_act, down: on_down, move: on_move, up: on_up, wheel: on_wheel, value: on_value, key: on_key, msg: on_msg, close: on_close, resized: resized }, null);
}
